          <a href="#food-safety" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">4. How Long Food Lasts</a>
          <a href="#cycling" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">5. Cycling the Fridge</a>
